    <briefdescription>
<para>Centralized handler for recovery-phase faults. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides standardized, fail-safe behavior for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Torn WAL entries (skip and emit diagnostic, continue replay)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Invalid checkpoints (emit diagnostic, attempt recovery from safe point)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Recovery timeouts (stop and emit alert)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>WAL file corruption (try alternate recovery strategies)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Replay errors (classify and decide whether to continue or stop)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safe: Safe to call concurrently from recovery threads. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
